== Notes ==

* This spell only removes the negative effects that lesser mind blank removes ([[confused]], [[dazed]], [[dominated]], [[charmed]], [[sleep]], and [[stunned]] and the spells [[bane]] and [[feeblemind]]).  It does not remove [[paralysis]] or [[frightened|fear]].
* Due to a .2da bug, ''mass charm'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

